                  "content": "Document: aloo-matar.md\nTitle: Aloo Matar\nSection: notes\n\n* Try adding paneer instead of or alongside the potatoes (making it either Matar Paneer or Aloo Matar Paneer), same cooking time applies",
                  "similarity": 0.6403877361546555
